# A Thief in Norg?! (battlefield.thief_in_norg): the requirement arms. Main, a level 50 Samurai with the quest accepted and
# the charm but Prog 5: BC_Entrance: the registrant's check (requiredVar 6 not met): no options. bob, Prog 6 and the charm,
# the quest only available: fails.
lists WaughroonShrine/BC_Entrance/onTrade
char zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=SAM lvl=50
char bob zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=SAM lvl=50
quest Outlands.AThiefInNorg accepted
charvar Quest[5][142]Prog 5
item BanishingCharm
bob: charvar Quest[5][142]Prog 6
bob: item BanishingCharm
login
trade BC_Entrance BanishingCharm x1     # Prog 5: no options
bob: login
bob: trade BC_Entrance BanishingCharm x1 # available: no options
